OL,3,GNEWSARacism, misogyny and homophobia
OL,4,Aremain in Met force, report finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new report has found institutional
OL,7,Fracism, misogyny and homophobia still
OL,8,Fexist in the Metropolitan Police, three
OL,9,Fyears after a damning review that
OL,10,Fcalled for significant changes.
OL,12,FThe landmark review by Dr Gillian
OL,13,FFairfield examined how much the UK's
OL,14,Fbiggest police force has changed since
OL,15,FBaroness Louise Casey's scathing review
OL,16,Fin 2023. It found the Met had failed to
OL,17,Fmake good progress in any area flagged
OL,18,Fas needing improvement.
OL,20,FMet Commissioner Sir Mark Rowley said
OL,21,Fhe accepted the Fairfield Review's
OL,22,Ffindings.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
